WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
So the politicians were using the local leaders to get the votes?

2
00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:03.500
Oh yeah.

3
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.220
Oh yeah.

4
00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.920
Politicians . . .Politicians used that.

5
00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:10.760
They used to come out there and their cars and pick you up and take you to the polls.

6
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.120
Who did?

7
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.536
Politicians before they start the . . .

8
00:00:13.536 --> 00:00:16.820
Remember anybody in particular?

9
00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:20.160
No. I know some elections like these that I'm telling you about.

10
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:27.380
Sheriff . . . just whoever . . . It was the thing.

11
00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:35.220
They'd come out here in the community and they'd give these black guys money and fill their car up with gas,

12
00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.260
and all you had to do was ride around and see who wanted to go to the polls.

13
00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:38.960
Take them to the polls,

14
00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:48.300
man. [laughs] I don't know if there's a law against that or not but that's really what . . .that’s really what happened.

15
00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:52.160
They were just using people, using them for that.

16
00:00:52.160 --> 00:01:02.840
I can see a politician now wanting to get elected as far as doing some things like that.

17
00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:10.600
If a person calls you up and asks you and you're able to furnish transportation for them.

18
00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:13.200
But just to go around . . . They didn't know who they was voting for.

19
00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:14.820
Voting for who they told to vote for.
